Vendored data snapshots for the routectl baked catalog table
==============================================================

This directory contains third-party data snapshots consumed by
`cargo run --bin gen_catalog` (see `../src/bin/gen_catalog.rs` and
`../src/catalog_codegen.rs`) to generate `../src/catalog_baked.rs`. Both
snapshots are used strictly as read-only reference data: numeric pricing
and capability facts are extracted programmatically, no source code from
either project is reused.

